# Documented Rust-only facade extensions visible to the runtime_surface probe.
#
# The C btech package installs exactly nine subpackages (unit, map, player,
# parts, character, repair, system, template, autopilot) plus error. The Rust
# facade additionally exposes native-command groups (runtime, cargo, weapon,
# inventory, database), the documented btech.errors alias of
# btech.error.codes (docs/lua-parts-contracts.md), and extension unit
# commands (including the checking-gated weapon_states) inside btech.unit.
# Policy preserves documented Rust extensions; these entries classify each
# extra key as permitted so the probe fails only on unexplained drift.
namespaces.btech.keys="string:cargo"
namespaces.btech.keys="string:database"
